# AgentProof & CooL SDK Configuration

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. COOL SDK CONFIGURATION (100% Offline Local Cryptography - No API Keys Needed)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CooL SDK uses pure Node.js WebCrypto, @noble/hashes, and @noble/post-quantum.
# It DOES NOT require any external API key, cloud database, or third-party service.
# Everything runs 100% locally and offline out-of-the-box!

# Optional: Intel TDX / Phala dstack endpoint socket (Only used in hardware TEE deployments).
# When omitted or empty, CooL automatically operates in built-in SIMULATED mode.
# COOL_DSTACK_ENDPOINT=/var/run/dstack.sock

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. OPTIONAL EXTERNAL INTEGRATIONS (Optional - Not Required for Hackathon MVP)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If you choose to connect an external Firebase database or external LLM API:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_firebase_api_key_here
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your_firebase_project_id_here
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here
